<item><title>World Bank prepares $760 million more for Niger&apos;s energy, farming and water</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/world-bank-prepares-760-million-more-for-niger-s-energy-2df9d2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ne/world-bank-prepares-760-million-more-for-niger-s-energy-2df9d2/</guid><category>Niger</category><description>The funding is added to more than $4 billion the World Bank already has committed in Niger, and is meant to support larger projects over the next five years.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:04:22 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ne.jpg" length="31036" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ne.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
